entityDescription:
Founded in March 1992, Cablotec has as main activities:
- Production and commercialization of specialized cabling, overmolding and mechanical, electrical and electronic systems for Industrial applications;
- Project and Production of moulds and tools;
- Production and commercialization of components.
Cablotec stood out in the market in an early time by providing high quality solutions at controlled costs and offering global services to its Clients. Cablotec provides specialized connectivity solutions for the Automotive, Telecom/Wireless, Computing, Broadcast, Energy & Power Management, Advanced Industrial, Medical, Military/Aerospace and Railway/Mass Transit Industries destined for the European Market, namely France, Germany, Switzerland, Spain and The United Kingdom.
